# Generated run outputs. `probe-out.txt` is rewritten by the `probe_timing` test
# (src/L13_namespace/module_probe_tests.rs), the rest are profiling/invocation
# snapshots. All are regenerable, so they stay untracked.
/probe-out.txt
/sampler.folded
/flamegraph.svg
/err*.txt
/out[0-9]*.txt
/prof*.txt
/clippy_*.txt

